This repository ports code and text from two earlier projects by the same author. Each ported
file names its source in a header comment.

Fermata (github.com/bilgin-kocak/fermata) @ d7cc642, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Bilgin Kocak:
  - contracts/escrow: a Soroban port of contracts/src/FermataEscrow.sol; the tests port
    contracts/test/*.t.sol case by case
  - crates/fermata-verdict/src/verdict.rs and hex32.rs: the Verdict type, outcome constants and
    hex serde helpers from apps/attestor/src/eip712.rs
  - crates/fermata-verdict/src/hashes.rs: apps/attestor/src/hashes.rs and its test vectors
  - predicates/quote-v1.json: apps/attestor/predicates/quote-v1.json, byte for byte
  - docs/trust-model.md, docs/security.md, README.md: text adapted from README.md and SECURITY.md
  - apps/vendor: apps/vendor/server.mjs and gen-certs.sh, unchanged
  - packages/sdk: src/hashes.ts and src/requestHash.ts from packages/sdk (same definitions), the
    isTrustedService check and the Verdict fields, and the hash vectors in its tests
  - scripts/attest-cases.sh: ported from scripts/e2e-attest.sh and scripts/attest-e2e.ts
  - contracts/escrow/src/tests/attest_vector.rs: ports contracts/test/AttestVector.t.sol
  - packages/sdk/src/mpp/method.ts, server.ts and client.ts: the `fermata` MPP method, ported from
    packages/sdk/src/method.ts, server.ts and client.ts
  - packages/sdk/src/scores.ts and eventually.ts, with their tests: ported from packages/sdk
    (eventually.ts and its test unchanged)
  - packages/sdk/src/reconcile.ts and relayer.ts: modelled on `reconcile` in
    packages/sdk/src/escrow.ts and the serialized wallet writes in apps/gateway/src/chain.ts
  - apps/gateway: src/app.ts, attestor.ts, chain.ts, config.ts and store.ts ported;
    src/upstream.ts copied; test/gateway.test.ts ported; scripts/agent.ts ported from
    scripts/demo/cases.ts and apps/gateway/test/e2e.test.ts; the session store in
    src/sessions.ts modelled on store.ts
  - apps/dashboard: src/App.tsx, api.ts, format.ts, vite.config.ts and index.html ported;
    src/main.tsx, styles.css and tsconfig.json copied unchanged (apart from a header comment)
  - scripts/gateway-cases.sh: ported from scripts/e2e-gateway.sh

